TITLE 1D transport, exchange example
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    temp 25
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    temp 25
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -step true
    -distance true
    -time true
USER_PUNCH 4
    -headings NaX
10 PUNCH MOL("NaX")
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
END
